      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>New recipe: ETS6 (KNX) — design and commissioning of KNX systems. Bring your own installer from my.knx.org (the demo works too). The recipe downloads the Wine Devel engine by itself (about 210 MB): ETS6&#x27;s main window needs it.</li><li>New downloadable engine: Wine Devel 11.18 — the newest Wine, for work programs that need the latest Wine fixes. For games, the other engines are better.</li><li>Recipes can now switch a bottle to the engine the program needs once its components are installed.</li></ul>]]></description>
